# env.optional — fallbacks / enrichment only; the skill runs without these.
# Apify Reddit/Amazon/review-site actor when search can't reach a hostile/volume source.
# If set -> Apify actor path; else -> keyless `site:` web search + the Playwright Meta
# scraper (default):
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Optional SERP upgrade for the customer-voice mining queries. If a DataForSEO (or Serper)
# key is set -> structured SERP API (higher coverage/precision); else -> the agent's keyless
# web search (default):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
SERPER_API_KEY
# Proxy for the Meta scraper and SERP mining (Robomotion Proxy):
HTTPS_PROXY
